WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.060
Read the video transcript Compare the two ideas on

00:00:03.165 --> 00:00:09.021
screen different roles and overlapping contributions An assistant office

00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:12.179
manager or chief of staff may contribute in different

00:00:12.258 --> 00:00:16.455
ways These are not a universal ranking of jobs

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:22.547
Now compare actual delegation with its specific conditions Technical

00:00:22.561 --> 00:00:26.100
ability and a senior-sounding title do not create permission

00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:28.903
to approve a payment or make a specialist decision

00:00:29.784 --> 00:00:33.205
When a request crosses the actual mandate identify the

00:00:33.271 --> 00:00:38.008
owner who can decide Useful coordination can continue without

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.442
pretending that authority has transferred
